ercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#d27d6f]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"event date and category\">\n                                Featured event · 24 September\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-3xl leading-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"event title\">\n                                September supper: a room full of good introductions\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#bcb0a4]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"event description\">\n                                Bring a question, bring a friend, or simply bring yourself. An evening for businesswomen from across Yorkshire.\n                            </p>\n                            <a class=\"mt-7 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 border-b border-[#d27d6f] pb-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f6f0e8]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"save seat button\" href=\"#join\">\n                                Save your seat\n                                <span class=\"text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"save seat arrow\">\n                                    →\n                                </span>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <div class=\"border-t border-white/15\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"events list\">\n                        <a class=\"grid grid-cols-[112px_1fr_auto] items-start gap-5 border-b border-white/15 py-6 group\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"event item link\" href=\"#event-two\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"event date\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#d27d6f]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"event day\">\n                                    02 