                        Three questions for the autumn quarter\n                            </p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"bg-[#a3413a] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" data-name=\"newsletter section\" id=\"join\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1240px] gap-8 px-8 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center lg:py-16\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"newsletter container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"newsletter content\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#f2c3bb]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"newsletter label\">\n                        A note from Yorkshire\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-4xl leading-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"newsletter headline\">\n                        One useful email for the week ahead.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-white/80\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-3\" data-name=\"newsletter description\">\n                        Every Friday: one local story, one practical idea, and the next room worth walking into.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <form action=\"#subscribe\" class=\"flex w-full max-w-xl flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"newsletter form\">\n                    <label class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"email label\" for=\"email\">\n                        Email address\n                    </label>\n                    <input class=\"h-12 min-w-0 flex-1 border border-white/40 bg-transparent px-4 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-white/65 outline-none focus:border-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"email input\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your email address\" type=\"email\"/>\n                    <button class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white px-6 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-[#a3413a] hover:bg-[#f5e8e1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"submit button\" type=\"submit\">\n                        Get the Friday note\n                        <span class=\"text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"submit button icon\">\n                            →\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-b border-[#ded6cc] bg-[#f4eee6]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" data-name=\"testimonial section\" id=\"members\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1240px] gap-12 px-8 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:items-center lg:py-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"testimonial container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1\" data-name=\"testimonial content\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#a3413a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"testimonial label\">\n                        Member voice\n                    </p>\n                    <blockquote class=\"font-serif text-4xl leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"testimonial quote\">\n                        “The most valuable part is the room you find yourself in afterwards—the introductions keep moving long after the event ends.”\n                    </blockquote>\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-3\" data-name=\"testimonial author\">\n                        <img alt=\"Zoe Hands\" class=\"h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"author portrait\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/testimonials/zoe-hands.png\"/>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"author details\">\n                            <p class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"author name\">\n                                Zoe Hands\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-[#776e66]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"author title\">\n                                Yorkshire BusinessWoman member\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#a3413a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-4\" data-name=\"testimonial link\" href=\"#members-directory\">\n                        Meet the members\n                        <span class=\"text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"testimonial arrow\">\n                            →\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-l border-[#d5ccc1] pl-8 lg:pl-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2\" data-name=\"stats content\">\n                    <p class=\"font-serif text-7xl leading-none text-[#a3413a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"stats count\">\n                        1,200+\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-7 text-[#776e66]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"stats description\">\n                        women connected through the Yorkshire BusinessWoman community, across events, introductions, and shared stories.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-full bg-[#d5ccc1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-3\" data-name=\"stats separator\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#776e66]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-4\" data-name=\"stats label\">\n                        A community with somewhere to go next\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#201b18] text-[#f6f0e8]\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"footer section\" id=\"about\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-8 py-14 lg:py-16\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n            <div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"footer content grid\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand block\">\n                    <img alt=\"Yorkshire BusinessWoman\" class=\"h-12 w-auto object-contain\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/logo-footer-v2.png\"/>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xs text-sm leading-7 text-[#bcb0a4]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer description\">\n                        A magazine and membership community for women shaping Yorkshire’s next chapter.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-5 text-xs text-[#8f8379]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"footer contact email\">\n                        editor@yorkshirebusinesswoman.co.uk\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer magazine links\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#d27d6f]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"magazine header\">\n                        Magazine\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-[#bcb0a4]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"magazine links list\">\n                        <a class=\"block hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"read desk link\" href=\"#desk\">\n                            Read the desk\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"block hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"browse topics link\" href=\"#topic